WEBVTT

00:04:56.476 --> 00:05:00.236
in ways which make people
and planet healthier.

00:05:00.236 --> 00:05:02.036
So what's holding us back?

00:05:02.436 --> 00:05:07.076
What will it take for this potential
to become a shared, lived reality?

00:05:07.436 --> 00:05:09.356
It would be easy for me to say money.

00:05:09.676 --> 00:05:10.956
So let me say it.

00:05:10.996 --> 00:05:12.676
Money, more money.

00:05:12.716 --> 00:05:13.716
(Laughter)

00:05:13.756 --> 00:05:15.396
It's a big part of the solution.

00:05:15.836 --> 00:05:18.916
We need to make good now on the handshake

00:05:18.916 --> 00:05:22.116
that we had at Paris
of 100 billion dollars.

00:05:22.916 --> 00:05:24.796
And that was promised annually.

00:05:25.156 --> 00:05:26.596
Rich countries,

00:05:26.636 --> 00:05:28.156
let me say here and now,

00:05:28.156 --> 00:05:31.476
we are looking at you
for the unfinished business.